# Content scripts

Classic scripts, not `type: module`. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#add-an-entry).

## Entry (`**/content/**/index.ts`)

```ts
import('@pages/content/ui/root');           // ✅
import('@pages/content/injected/myFeature'); // ✅ second feature, same injection
import Root from '@pages/content/ui/root';   // ❌
```

Only the entry is restricted. `myFeature.ts` / `root.tsx` may static-import.

## New injection vs extra file

- Same matches → more `import()` in the existing entry, **or** another Vite key listed in the same `js: []`.
- Different matches / `run_at` → new Vite key + new `content_scripts` `{}`. Manifest path is `src/pages/<key>/index.js`, not `src/pages/content/<folder>/index.js`.

Stay **`world`: ISOLATED** (default). Split chunks + `import()` are not for MAIN world.

## Styles

- Shadow UI: `?inline` into the shadow root (`ui/root.tsx`).
- Host page: `style.scss` → `contentStyle<KEY>.chunk.css`.
- No bare `import './file.css'`.
